@startuml
title Features: Product Catalog & Details
skinparam maxMessageSize 150
autonumber

actor "User / Admin" as User
participant "Browser (Vue SPA)" as Browser
participant "Laravel (BFF)" as BFF
participant "Product API" as API
participant "Inventory/Deposit API" as DepositAPI

== Feature 10, 12, 16: Complex Product Search & Catalog ==

User -> Browser: Access Catalog / Product Search
Browser -> BFF: GET /api/products?q=Aspirin&search_type=commercial
BFF -> API: GET /catalog/search?name=Aspirin
API -> BFF: Search Results
BFF -> Browser: Display Live Catalog (Feat 16)

User -> Browser: Change Filter: "Search by Active Principle" (Feat 12)
Browser -> BFF: GET /api/products?q=Acetylsalicylic&search_type=active_principle
BFF -> API: GET /catalog/search?active_ingredient=Acetylsalicylic
API -> BFF: Medical Equivalents List
BFF -> Browser: Updated Product Results

== Feature 13, 15: Rich Media Attachments ==

User -> Browser: Click "View Leaflet / Photo" (Feat 13, 15)
Browser -> BFF: GET /api/products/{id}/attachments
BFF -> API: GET /products/{id}/media
API -> BFF: Presigned Blob URLs (PDFs, Images)
BFF -> Browser: Render Image / PDF Viewer Component

== Feature 11, 14: Sourcing & Backup Deposits ==

User -> Browser: Check availability / Select Sourcing (Feat 14)
Browser -> BFF: GET /api/products/{id}/availability
BFF -> DepositAPI: GET /inventory/primary?product_id={id}

alt Standard Hospital Deposit has stock
    DepositAPI -> BFF: Available locally
    BFF -> Browser: Show "In Stock" & Enable Add to Cart
else Primary Deposit out of stock
    BFF -> DepositAPI: GET /inventory/backup?product_id={id} (Feat 11)
    DepositAPI -> BFF: Stock status in Backup Deposit
    BFF -> Browser: Show "Available from External/Backup Deposit"
end

@enduml
